+ * the timestamp of each message it logs, such as UMIP's warning). Each
+ * domain keeps the last RDTSC_PAIR_LOG of them for the 't' dump, and follows the
+ * first RDTSC_PAIR_VCPUS vCPUs. User RDTSCs in a program's own code are also the
+ * only ones RDTSC_POC compresses, unless RDTSC_KERNEL_ADJUST.
